flowchart TB
  subgraph Origin[Monitored Linux origin]
    Agent[Guardian Go agent]
    WebServer[Apache / nginx]
    Runtime[PHP-FPM / runtime]
    Recorder[Bounded local recorder]
    Agent --- WebServer
    Agent --- Runtime
    Agent --- Recorder
  end
  Agent -->|Outbound HTTPS only| ALB[Application Load Balancer]
  subgraph AWS[Guardian AWS control plane]
    ALB --> Web[guardian-web\nECS Fargate]
    ALB --> API[guardian-api\nECS Fargate]
    API --> DDB[(DynamoDB)]
    API --> S3[(S3 evidence)]
    API --> Queue[SQS + DLQ]
    Queue --> Worker[guardian-worker\nECS Fargate]
    Worker --> Bedrock[Bedrock / AgentCore]
    Worker --> WhatsApp[AWS End User Messaging Social\nWhatsApp]
    Worker --> SES[Amazon SES]
    Web --> DDB
    Web --> S3
    Logs[CloudWatch logs / metrics / alarms]
    API --> Logs
    Worker --> Logs
    Web --> Logs
  end
  WhatsApp -->|Authenticated operator reply| Worker
  Worker -->|Signed allowlisted command| API
  API -->|Agent polls outbound| Agent
